    <title>vol.130 | 人生，是一场盛大的“望梅止渴”吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68766bbd93fd2d72b85cfa92</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68766bbd93fd2d72b85cfa92</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 16 Jul 2025 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>-聊天的人-</span></h2><span></span><p><span>大野</span></p><span></span><p><span>咸鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span>蛋糕</span></p><span></span><p><span>羽毛</span></p><span></span><p><span>苹果</span></p><span></span><p><span>小羊</span></p><span></span><h2><span>-你将听到-</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="172">02:52</a> 高考∶将“一本线”当作梅子，奔赴人生中第一次大考！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="208">03:28</a> 疫情影响∶一模还能线上考试？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="407">06:47</a> 信心倍增的起点∶一模过重本线，虽然只有1分！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="446">07:26</a>伟大的导演梦∶住宿生被逼无奈的天马行空～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="526">08:46</a>日历与摆件∶高中生对假期“望梅止渴”的具象化～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="781">13:01</a>上了大学就轻松∶不知贯穿18年，而是一生！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a> 玩玩玩∶对台湾五月天演唱会的“望梅止渴”～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="945">15:45</a> 范世琦∶追行程的幸福时刻！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 负重十斤也幸福∶时代少年团演唱会释放女汉子人格！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1249">20:49</a> 谁还没疯狂过∶看五月天演唱会的超长计划与“变态”行程！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1382">23:02</a> 南昌糟糕之旅∶是否提前享受望梅止渴的果子？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a> 皮格马利翁效应∶望梅止渴到底是积极还是消极的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 小姑的画饼∶至今没得到饼～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1610">26:50</a> 实习老板画饼∶薪资与工作内容都能模糊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1815">30:15</a> 自主意识觉醒∶反抗别人画饼，接受自己给的望梅止渴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1970">32:50</a> 小红书攻略∶他人画饼还是自己在画饼？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2210">36:50</a> 消费主义裹挟∶对奢侈品包包的执念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2235">37:15</a> 和尚找水源∶望梅止渴中找到自己的大方向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2387">39:47</a> 望梅止渴思考重点∶必须要走的路or自己选择的路？</span></p><span></span><p><span>-后期制作-</span></p><span></span><p><span>苹果</span></p><span></span><p><span>米饭</span></p><span></span><p><span>汀兰</span></p><span></span><p><span>大蟑</span></p><span></span><p><span>-内容制作-</span></p><span></span><p><span>苹果</span></p><span></span><p><span>小羊</span></p><span></span><p><span>-音乐-</span></p><span></span><p><span>光和音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>-LOGO设计-</span></p><span></span><p><span>一口气能吃十个鲜花饼</span></p><span></span><p><span>-关注我们-</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：159号仓</span></p><span></span><p><span>-联系我们-</span></p><span></span><p><span>Warehouse159@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
